  "title": "February 2026 Product Updates",
  "summary": "We released several February updates to the Thunkable platform focused on improving everyday building workflows and reducing iteration time. New features include Fast Edits for quicker small changes without full rebuilds, built-in and customizable images for more complete app visuals from the start, and Version History to review or restore earlier project states.",
